text = "OBJECTIVE
Stop the fruit enemies from reaching the end of the path.

PLACING TANKS
Select a tank from the shop.
Move it to where you want it.
Left-click to place it.
Tanks cannot be placed on the road.
Tank starts attacking as soon as you buy it, even before you place it down, if an enemy is within its range

UPGRADING
Right-click a placed tank to open the upgrade menu.
Upgrading increases damage and attack speed.

MONEY
Defeating enemies gives you money.
Use money to buy and upgrade tanks.

WAVES
Press Next Wave to start the next wave.
Different enemies appear as the waves increase."

